The Data Unit will also assist the state team to identify performance issues and promising 
practices by reviewing the results of performance measures significantly at variance with 
computed national averages. The data unit staff will analyze data gathered over several 
fiscal years to determine performance trends on such issues as: 

• types of services provided and expenditures on these services; 
