Do not discriminate in any facet of the business based on sex, age, religion, race, color, creed, national origin, political affiliation, disability, marital status, pregnancy, parenthood, sexual orientation / gender identity or expression and ensure compliance with all federal and state laws related to discrimination.
Protect the assets of the Alaska BEP and do not willfully or maliciously damage state-owned equipment or the premises on which the vending facility is located;
Act responsibly when posting or reposting on social media by refraining from using profanity, using hate speech or inflammatory language aimed toward any individual or group or category of people, posting unapproved photographs of the vending facility, posting negative comments about customers, grantors, BEP staff, and others with whom I have a business relationship as the result of managing my vending facility, and never posting pictures or other content not suitable for children;

